{"id": "559542", "name": "פונקציית הסתברות על הטבעיים – מציאת C מתוך P({n, n+2})", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\mathbb{P} \\)</span> מידת הסתברות על המרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\Omega=\\mathbb{N}=\\{0,1,2,...\\} \\)</span> המקיימת</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}\\left[ \\{ n,n+2 \\} \\right]=C\\cdot{{CT:0}}^{-n} \\]</p><p>לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( n\\in\\mathbb{N} \\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחלקים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> לזוגות זרים מהצורה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{n,n+2\\}\\)</span>, וסכום ההסתברויות שלהם הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(\\Omega)=1\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — חלוקה לזוגות</b><br>הזוגות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{0,2\\},\\{1,3\\},\\{4,6\\},\\{5,7\\},\\{8,10\\},\\dots\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{n,n+2\\}\\)</span> עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n=4k\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n=4k+1\\)</span>, זרים ואיחודם הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>. לפי האדיטיביות הבת-מנייה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 1=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\Big(\\mathbb{P}[\\{4k,4k+2\\}]+\\mathbb{P}[\\{4k+1,4k+3\\}]\\Big)=C\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\left({{CT:0}}^{-4k}+{{CT:0}}^{-4k-1}\\right) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סכום הטור הגאומטרי</b><br>מוציאים גורם משותף, ונשאר טור גאומטרי עם מנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:0}}^{-4}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ C\\left(1+\\frac{1}{ {{CT:0}} }\\right)\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}{{CT:0}}^{-4k}=C\\cdot\\frac{ {{CT:1}} }{ {{CT:0}} }\\cdot\\frac{1}{1-{{CT:0}}^{-4}}=C\\cdot\\frac{ {{CT:1}}\\cdot{{CT:2}} }{ {{CT:3}} } \\]</p>ולכן:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ C=\\frac{ {{CT:3}} }{ {{CT:1}}\\cdot{{CT:2}} }={{CT:4}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["la", "ta"], "nvariants": 14}